## ADGradients: estimates parameters whose derivatives used to be dropped in autodiff builds
## (normal ageing error cv, lognormal growth cv_first feeding a length-based selectivity).
## adolc, betadiff and gammadiff must reach the same MPD. See design-docs/nuts-phase1-fixes.md
!include "population.csl2"
!include "Observation.csl2"
!include "estimation.csl2"
!include "report.csl2"

## Reference MPD (all three minimisers agree): ageing_error cv 0.191214, growth cv_first 0.08638, objective 679.644.
## Before the Phase 1 fixes adolc/betadiff stopped at the start values for both cvs (objective ~682.9),
## so the tolerance is tight enough to fail on either chain break.
@assert ObjectiveFunction
type objective_function
value 679.644
tolerance 1e-3
error_type error

@minimiser ADOLC
type ADOLC
tolerance 1e-6
iterations 2000
active true
parameter_transformation sin_transform


